  /// ApiDestinations, the corresponding Connection can also have these values
  /// configured. In case of any conflicting keys, values from the Connection
  /// take precedence.
  pub http_parameters: HttpParameters? = None
  /// Contains the Amazon Redshift Data API parameters to use when the target
